Package: neuronsDG
Type: Package
Title: Modelling Neurons via Dichotomized Gaussians
Version: 1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Michael",
                   family = "Barkasi",
                   role = c("aut", "cre"),
                   email = "barkasi@wustl.edu")
Description: Various tools for modeling neurons with dichotomized Gaussians. Defines a Cpp class 'neuron' intended to model a single neuron, accessible through R functions. Provides analysis methods for autocorrelation and cross-correlation.
License: GPL-3
Imports: Rcpp (>= 1.0.13), R.matlab, hdf5r, reticulate, nloptr, methods
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppEigen, BH, nloptr
Depends: ggplot2, grid, gridExtra, colorspace
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), mvtnorm, Matrix, MASS
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/Needs/website: rmarkdown
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
